OL,3,GNEWSATwo friends who died on mountain
OL,4,Aridge tried calling 999, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo friends who died on a mountain
OL,7,Fridge during extreme winter conditions
OL,8,Ftried calling 999 but the alert was not
OL,9,Fescalated "as it should have been",
OL,10,Faccording to a police expert at an
OL,11,Finquest.
OL,13,FThe bodies of Eddie Hill, 20, and
OL,14,FJayden Long, 19, both from Dereham,
OL,15,FNorfolk, were found by a mountain
OL,16,Frescue team in Eryri, also known as
OL,17,FSnowdonia, on 19 February.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
